\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God is gone up on high,
\par With a triumphant noise;
\par The clarions of the sky
\par Proclaim the angelic joys!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Join all on earth, rejoice and sing;
\par Glory ascribe to glory's King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. God in the flesh below,
\par For us He reigns above:
\par Let all the nations know
\par Our Jesu's conquering love!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Join all on earth, rejoice and sing;
\par Glory ascribe to glory's King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. All power to our great Lord
\par Is by the Father given;
\par By angel hosts adored,
\par He reigns supreme in heaven:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Join all on earth, rejoice and sing;
\par Glory ascribe to glory's King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. High on His holy seat
\par He bears the righteous sway;
\par His foes beneath His feet
\par Shall sink and die away:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Join all on earth, rejoice and sing;
\par Glory ascribe to glory's King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. His foes and ours are one,
\par Satan, the world, and sin;
\par But He shall tread them down,
\par And bring His kingdom in:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Join all on earth, rejoice and sing;
\par Glory ascribe to glory's King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Till all the earth, renewed
\par In righteousness divine,
\par With all the hosts of God
\par In one great chorus join.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Join all on earth, rejoice and sing;
\par Glory ascribe to glory's King.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

